%dialog.sheet{'aria-labelledby': 'settings_title', data: {generator_target: 'settings', action: 'click->generator#backdrop'}}
  .sheet-head
    %h2#settings_title More settings
    %span all optional
    %button.x{type: 'button', 'aria-label': 'Close', data: {action: 'generator#close'}} &times;
  %p.intro
    Fine-tune your template here. Kerf matters most: it is the width of material the laser burns away,
    and the drawing makes up for it so the tabs fit snugly. The default, 0.026 in (0.66 mm), suits most
    wood; the colour of the slider shows how the box will likely fit, from loose enough to need glue or
    screws to too tight to put together.
  -# Two columns, filled top to bottom: the kerf slider, kerf, padding and page size on the left.
  .grid2
    %label.kerf-adjust
      Kerf adjustment:
      %input{type: 'range', min: 0, max: 0.1, step: 0.0005, 'aria-describedby': 'kerf_fit',
             data: {generator_target: 'kerfSlider', action: 'input->generator#slideKerf'}}
      %small#kerf_fit{data: {generator_target: 'kerfFit'}}
    %label
      Kerf
      %input{name: 'box[kerf]', inputmode: 'decimal', data: {generator_target: 'optional', action: 'input->generator#edit'}}
      %small The width of the laser's cut.
    %label
      Padding
      %input{name: 'box[padding]', inputmode: 'decimal', data: {generator_target: 'optional', action: 'input->generator#edit'}}
      %small Space between the panels.
    %label
      Page size
      %select{name: 'box[page_size]', data: {generator_target: 'pageSize', action: 'change->generator#edit'}}
        %option{value: ''} Fit the box
      %small A fixed size can split the drawing across pages. PDF only.
    %label
      Margin
      %input{name: 'box[margin]', inputmode: 'decimal', data: {generator_target: 'optional', action: 'input->generator#edit'}}
      %small From the edge of the page.
    %label
      Stroke
      %input{name: 'box[stroke]', inputmode: 'decimal', data: {generator_target: 'optional', action: 'input->generator#edit'}}
      %small Line width in the file.
    %label
      Page layout
      %select{name: 'box[page_layout]', data: {action: 'change->generator#edit'}}
        %option{value: 'portrait'} Portrait
        %option{value: 'landscape'} Landscape
      %small PDF only.
    .check
      -# Unticked, the hidden 0 is what the form sends; ticked, the 1 after it wins.
      %input{type: 'hidden', name: 'box[metadata]', value: '0'}
      %label
        Include box dimensions?
        %input{type: 'checkbox', name: 'box[metadata]', value: '1', checked: true,
               data: {generator_target: 'metadata', action: 'change->generator#edit'}}
      %small Printed on the page. PDF only.
  .sheet-foot
    %button.link{type: 'button', data: {action: 'generator#reset'}} Reset everything to defaults
    %button.done{type: 'button', data: {action: 'generator#close'}} Done
